A python interface to the halo model in ../Halomodel.h (the standard halo model and HMcode-2016).

make                  builds the module _halomodel (pybind11: pip install pybind11)
HaloModelWrapper.py   the class HaloModel around it (P(k, z), one- and two-halo terms, n(M), b(M), deltac(z))
example.py            an example (needs matplotlib)

HMcode-2020 is FML::COSMOLOGY::HALOMODEL::HMcode2020 (../HMcode2020.h) and is used through the Einstein-Boltzmann
solver (nonlinear = hmcode2020).
